578
00:48:44,630 --> 00:48:45,756
MANAGER NA WON-BIN

579
00:48:46,715 --> 00:48:47,883
Yes, Mr. Na.

580
00:48:50,469 --> 00:48:51,470
What?

581
00:48:53,556 --> 00:48:57,393
Someone posted
a terrorist threat online.

582
00:48:57,601 --> 00:48:59,311
It's likely to be a prank

583
00:48:59,728 --> 00:49:02,064
