to search the whole area.

584
00:49:02,648 --> 00:49:04,066
So we had to cancel the venue.

585
00:49:05,734 --> 00:49:08,988
So the place we booked in a rush is

586
00:49:09,989 --> 00:49:11,239
here.

587
00:49:11,240 --> 00:49:12,241
CONCERT HALL

588
00:49:15,744 --> 00:49:16,995
Isn't it too small?

589
00:49:16,996 --> 00:49:18,497
The stage is too close
to the audience.

590
00:49:19,874 --> 00:49:22,209
So we'll have to change
the stage outfit.

591
00:49:23,961 --> 00:49:26,630
- Our key merchandise too?
- Sorry about that.

592
00:49:27,381 --> 00:49:29,717
I'll have to ask you to change it
according to their new stage outfit.

593
00:50:14,762 --> 00:50:17,223
Announce the change of address
on all available channels.

594
00:50:20,851 --> 00:50:22,228
CHANGE IN SHOWCASE VENUE

595
00:50:23,896 --> 00:50:25,147
Let me check.

596
00:50:25,564 --> 00:50:27,816
Show only the half
of the merchandise shelf.

597
00:50:28,400 --> 00:50:31,278
Since it's invitation only,
create a registration link.

598
00:50:34,490 --> 00:50:35,573
1ST D.N.X FANDOM PRESIDENT

599
00:50:35,574 --> 00:50:37,910
My blood is finally pumping again.

600
00:50:39,787 --> 00:50:41,454
Pay attention, D-Angels.

601
00:50:41,455 --> 00:50:43,332
This is where D.N.X is performing
for real.

602
00:50:43,707 --> 00:50:44,959
Check the link and run for it.

603
00:50:52,841 --> 00:50:54,175
1ST D.N.X FANDOM PRESIDENT
CHECK THE LINK

604
00:50:54,176 --> 00:50:55,261
THE WHOLE GROUP? FOR REAL?
I'M IN TEARS

605
00:51:04,311 --> 00:51:06,230
SATURDAY, OCTOBER 3, 2026
ART LIVE HALL

606
00:51:17,366 --> 00:51:18,993
Enjoy cheering.

607
00:51:19,285 --> 00:51:21,744
Hello, take one.

608
00:51:21,745 --> 00:51:23,496
- Enjoy cheering.
- Good luck.

609
00:51:23,497 --> 00:51:24,706
Thank you.

610
00:51:24,707 --> 00:51:26,833
- Hello. Take one.
- Enjoy cheering.

611
00:51:26,834 --> 00:51:28,793
- Check if that's you.
- Did you make that yourself?

612
00:51:28,794 --> 00:51:30,128
- Yes.
- Nice.

613
00:51:30,129 --> 00:51:31,630
- That's so cool.
- Thank you.

614
00:51:32,131 --> 00:51:33,382
President Kim!

615
00:51:34,341 --> 00:51:35,550
I was waiting for your post!

616
00:51:35,551 --> 00:51:37,135
- I read your posting.
- Really?

617
00:51:37,136 --> 00:51:38,678
- Did you read my post?
- Yes.

618
00:51:38,679 --> 00:51:39,762
Awesome.

619
00:51:39,763 --> 00:51:41,264
Here. Take one.

620
00:51:41,265 --> 00:51:42,766
- Thank you.
- We'll be cheering inside.

621
00:51:48,939 --> 00:51:49,940
All right.

622
00:51:50,357 --> 00:51:52,610
Lastly, you need to put
on the merchandise from Appello.

623
00:51:55,237 --> 00:51:56,362
Hello.

624
00:51:56,363 --> 00:51:58,490
- Hello.
- Good to see you again.

625
00:52:05,831 --> 00:52:06,957
Ta-da.

626
00:52:16,008 --> 00:52:17,801
That's nice.
That looks like a shooting star.

627
00:52:18,135 --> 00:52:19,928
- Is that...
- Yes.

628
00:52:21,096 --> 00:52:23,139
The stage is smaller.

629
00:52:23,140 --> 00:52:24,975
