to get closer to you.

630
00:52:26,352 --> 00:52:29,355
So I just added small details.

631
00:52:31,023 --> 00:52:33,025
The closest light you can see.

632
00:52:45,663 --> 00:52:46,705
Thank you

633
00:52:47,373 --> 00:52:48,916
