638
00:53:19,863 --> 00:53:20,948
See it for yourself.

639
00:53:23,784 --> 00:53:25,660
It's worth coming all the way here.

640
00:53:25,661 --> 00:53:27,495
I get to see them in front.

641
00:53:27,496 --> 00:53:28,996
Gosh, I'm so nervous.

642
00:53:28,997 --> 00:53:30,457
I hope Roy does well.

643
00:53:34,378 --> 00:53:35,379
I believe

644
00:53:36,213 --> 00:53:37,463
