657
00:54:09,913 --> 00:54:11,081
It should be a national holiday.

658
00:54:12,291 --> 00:54:13,333
Wait.

659
00:54:13,834 --> 00:54:14,918
Let's go.

660
00:54:20,632 --> 00:54:23,093
Okay, they waited nine years for us.

661
00:54:23,886 --> 00:54:25,554
- Let's give our all.
- Okay.

662
00:54:29,641 --> 00:54:31,267
- One.
- Two.

663
00:54:31,268 --> 00:54:32,603
- Three.
- Four.

664
00:54:32,936 --> 00:54:34,687
Five. Let's go.

665
00:54:34,688 --> 00:54:36,273
- Let's go!
- Let's go!

666
00:55:01,215 --> 00:55:02,924
- Get in the picture.
- Okay.

667
00:55:02,925 --> 00:55:05,135
One, two, three.

668
00:55:28,075 --> 00:55:29,326
They're here!

669
00:56:02,192 --> 00:56:03,944
Hyeok!

670
00:56:04,152 --> 00:56:05,945
Hyeok!

671
00:56:05,946 --> 00:56:07,072
So cool!

672
00:56:13,537 --> 00:56:19,126
- D.N.X!
- D.N.X!

673
00:56:22,004 --> 00:56:23,504
I love them.

674
00:56:23,505 --> 00:56:29,469
- D.N.X!
- D.N.X!

675
00:56:32,890 --> 00:56:33,891
Well...

676
00:56:34,558 --> 00:56:37,561
We weren't sure what to sing
for our first song.

677
00:56:38,312 --> 00:56:39,354
But first

678
00:56:39,730 --> 00:56:43,108
thank you so much for waiting for us
for all these years.

679
00:56:51,199 --> 00:56:52,284
This song is...

680
00:56:58,624 --> 00:56:59,833
dedicated to you and everyone...

681
00:57:00,626 --> 00:57:02,711
who helped us...

682
00:57:04,296 --> 00:57:05,923
get back on stage.

683
00:57:10,761 --> 00:57:11,845
The title is...

684
00:57:14,556 --> 00:57:15,557
"YOU."

685
00:57:33,492 --> 00:57:38,162
Perhaps everything that shines

686
00:57:38,163 --> 00:57:42,249
Fades away every day

687
00:57:42,250 --> 00:57:46,671
Dreaming makes me feel like myself

688
00:57:46,672 --> 00:57:51,008
But now,
I'm barely surviving each day

689
00:57:51,009 --> 00:57:55,471
The attention that surrounds me

690
00:57:55,472 --> 00:58:00,142
And waiting for the cheers

691
00:58:00,143 --> 00:58:04,355
Makes me nervous
like walking on thin ice

692
00:58:04,356 --> 00:58:07,692
I close my eyes and dream

693
00:58:07,693 --> 00:58:08,901
- Goodnight
- Chan.

694
00:58:08,902 --> 00:58:12,114
Sometimes everything brings me

695
00:58:13,949 --> 00:58:16,910
Down

696
00:58:17,911 --> 00:58:24,793
Only you make me feel like I exist

697
00:58:25,252 --> 00:58:26,378
So cool!

698
00:58:27,004 --> 00:58:31,132
When I get lost

699
00:58:31,133 --> 00:58:35,220
In the world

700
00:58:35,971 --> 00:58:37,722
Through all time

701
00:58:37,723 --> 00:58:41,017
- And space
- Hyeok!

702
00:58:41,018 --> 00:58:45,355
We'll dream together again

703
00:58:46,982 --> 00:58:51,318
Only you

704
00:58:51,319 --> 00:58:54,197
Make me feel like I exist

705
00:59:00,162 --> 00:59:02,872
BACK AS FIVE AGAIN
D-ANGEL WILL BE WITH YOU FOREVER

706
00:59:02,873 --> 00:59:04,791
SHINING STARS ON STAGE
D.N.X FOREVER

707
00:59:11,506 --> 00:59:15,552
It's surprising

708
00:59:15,927 --> 00:59:19,221
How time changes everything

709
00:59:19,222 --> 00:59:20,473
Roy!

710
00:59:20,474 --> 00:59:24,186
We were nothing at first

711
00:59:25,437 --> 00:59:26,730
I once

712
00:59:27,022 --> 00:59:28,940
chased after a shining star.

713
00:59:34,404 --> 00:59:36,615
But what lit my path

714
00:59:37,491 --> 00:59:38,825
