723
01:00:14,111 --> 01:00:15,821
All these lights are

724
01:00:16,738 --> 01:00:21,243
stars emitting their own light
from where they are.

725
01:00:23,036 --> 01:00:30,335
Only you make me feel like I exist

726
01:00:31,711 --> 01:00:34,130
When I get lost

727
01:00:34,131 --> 01:00:39,636
In the world

728
01:00:40,971 --> 01:00:45,724
Through all time and space

729
01:00:45,725 --> 01:00:50,230
We'll dream together again

730
01:00:51,690 --> 01:00:56,110
Only you

731
01:00:56,111 --> 01:00:58,989
Make me feel like I exist

732
01:01:16,298 --> 01:01:18,466
The moment
I become someone's light...

733
01:01:22,220 --> 01:01:23,346
I, too

734
01:01:24,598 --> 01:01:25,640
