735
01:01:46,828 --> 01:01:48,038
Over here.

736
01:01:50,665 --> 01:01:52,417
Oh, bubbles.

737
01:01:59,674 --> 01:02:00,675
Da-reum.

738
01:02:05,388 --> 01:02:06,389
It's so cute.

739
01:02:10,101 --> 01:02:12,312
- Do you like it?
- I love it.

740
01:02:13,980 --> 01:02:16,024
Get me a ring and make it a full set.

741
01:02:18,777 --> 01:02:19,778
No.

742
01:02:21,529 --> 01:02:22,739
